", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.repost/3mw4rqm2esj23", "cid": "bafyreicp5nnk7ki3zledt3u2ymqkahh5dbp7ncetgldzlkrupckzqwlwd4", "indexedAt": "2026-09-22T17:45:05.911Z", "$type": "app.bsky.feed.defs#reasonRepost"}}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mw4ri466js2v", "cid": "bafyreif3djtj6fkw6abjgqp3lmltqs6n2xemnirragq4e5rariqncie2ki", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh", "handle": "zekehausfather.com", "displayName": "Zeke Hausfather", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreickhtiozrypw6piordncabea5aztasgojgfb7467rjau6b3sr366m", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-09T21:00:55.757Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-22T17:40:17.000Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1540, "width": 3000}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreic5bchwyxxucfbbky5t7j3zsv5ggd5awzd5be57xb2xmimsgnxbae"}, "mimeType": "image/png", "size": 663706}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02939-x"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 302, "byteStart": 279}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I have a new piece out in Nature today on the record-breaking 2026/2027 El Niño, what impacts we should expect, and how governments can prepare. The Niño3.4 region is currently running more than 1C hotter than any prior event on record, and we remain months away from the peak www.nature.com/artic..."}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreic5bchwyxxucfbbky5t7j3zsv5ggd5awzd5be57xb2xmimsgnxbae", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreic5bchwyxxucfbbky5t7j3zsv5ggd5awzd5be57xb2xmimsgnxbae", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1540, "width": 3000}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 25, "replyCount": 5, "repostCount": 115, "likeCount": 210, "quoteCount": 11, "indexedAt": "2026-09-22T17:40:18.258Z", "labels": []}, "opThreadPostIndex": 1, "opThreadPostCount": 2}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mw4jyeeg6a2n", "cid": "bafyreiak63xtqkwrwnwxx6g4iv3athcjimwjavot5vacirvnwvysxv5gl4", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh", "handle": "zekehausfather.com", "displayName": "Zeke Hausfather", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreickhtiozrypw6piordncabea5aztasgojgfb7467rjau6b3sr366m", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-09T21:00:55.757Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-22T15:26:12.000Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 866, "width": 790}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreihvnbwimbsmyrtzkjhtrtfs2zidbmrylvht3nn7fjmjb4wytvhgvm"}, "mimeType": "image/png", "size": 741476}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/22/opinion/climate-temperature-extreme.html"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 299, "byteStart": 276}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "The world has made real progress in steering away from some of the darkest climate futures where global emissions doubled (or more) this century. But as David Wallace-Wells and I note in today's NYT, we are not out of the woods yet, and climate uncertainty is not our friend: www.nytimes.com/2026..."}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreihvnbwimbsmyrtzkjhtrtfs2zidbmrylvht3nn7fjmjb4wytvhgvm", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreihvnbwimbsmyrtzkjhtrtfs2zidbmrylvht3nn7fjmjb4wytvhgvm", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 866, "width": 790}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 28, "replyCount": 4, "repostCount": 71, "likeCount": 174, "quoteCount": 9, "indexedAt": "2026-09-22T15:26:13.966Z", "labels": []}, "opThreadPostIndex": 1, "opThreadPostCount": 11}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:touv7uc4vhnwrfn7n7xxk6hl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvzw3e72xc2x", "cid": "bafyreiax6j4cllpzxyl2gupgy6hz4gvx6ekkk4qycsmspwqsq2pklnvkuy", "author": {"did": "did:plc:touv7uc4vhnwrfn7n7xxk6hl", "handle": "rahmstorf.bsky.social", "displayName": "Prof. Stefan Rahmstorf", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:touv7uc4vhnwrfn7n7xxk6hl/bafkreibf6uszsmmk7xo2icgg2xysdc2uzpcklgfju2vocmjhctbhldonqi", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-10-02T17:42:09.745Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-21T14:24:39.257Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "‘Godzilla-level’ phenomenon is supercharging the climate crisis and will have a huge impact on communities across the world", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreibmuyvxvgcssqtd7oleli7wiuv77mxdgvfpkbiocof7z5c4432ohi"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 381497}, "title": "‘Jaw-dropping’ El Niño bursts through temperature record months before peak", "uri": "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/sep/21/super-el-nino-temperature-record?CMP=Share_iOSApp_Other"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 219, "byteStart": 200}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/sep/21/super-el-nino-temperature-record?CMP=Share_iOSApp_Other"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 256, "byteStart": 221}}], "langs": ["de"], "text": "“Very strong El Niño events like those in 1997/1998 and 2015/2016 were associated with hundreds of billions of dollars in damages globally – this event is leaving those past ones in the dust.” @zekehausfather.com \nwww.theguardian.com/environment/..."}, "embed": {"external": {"uri": "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/sep/21/super-el-nino-temperature-record?CMP=Share_iOSApp_Other", "title": "‘Jaw-dropping’ El Niño bursts through temperature record months before peak", "description": "‘Godzilla-level’ phenomenon is supercharging the climate crisis and will have a huge impact on communities across the world", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:touv7uc4vhnwrfn7n7xxk6hl/bafkreibmuyvxvgcssqtd7oleli7wiuv77mxdgvfpkbiocof7z5c4432ohi"}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 8, "replyCount": 5, "repostCount": 124, "likeCount": 252, "quoteCount": 1, "indexedAt": "2026-09-21T14:24:41.769Z", "labels": []}, "reason": {"by": {"did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh", "handle": "zekehausfather.com", "displayName": "Zeke Hausfather", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreickhtiozrypw6piordncabea5aztasgojgfb7467rjau6b3sr366m", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-09T21:00:55.757Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.repost/3mw27s6ktiv2a", "cid": "bafyreidt2ywwtytmh7zqh56sxgpaa7oe2iegcn25waimwyabdkcbueh6ge", "indexedAt": "2026-09-21T17:18:28.867Z", "$type": "app.bsky.feed.defs#reasonRepost"}, "opThreadPostIndex": 1, "opThreadPostCount": 2}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mw25ts6a362i", "cid": "bafyreidnk4pqmffqd4u6qexyf44uaj4ctvv5xiprp46iauy3jbbo77l27a", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh", "handle": "zekehausfather.com", "displayName": "Zeke Hausfather", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreickhtiozrypw6piordncabea5aztasgojgfb7467rjau6b3sr366m", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-09T21:00:55.757Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-21T16:43:35.000Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1843, "width": 3000}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreiaszt6aob76s5yatx7c2fnwm3whl2jvvirub3oix5cpiiakb3mx6q"}, "mimeType": "image/png", "size": 1838308}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.carbonbrief.org/analysis-super-el-nino-reaches-remarkable-all-time-record"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 225, "byteStart": 202}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "This year's El Niño event is moving into record territory, with the daily Oceanic Niño Index (ONI) tying the record previously set during the 2015/2016 super-El Niño. My latest over at Carbon Brief: www.carbonbrief.org/..."}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreiaszt6aob76s5yatx7c2fnwm3whl2jvvirub3oix5cpiiakb3mx6q", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreiaszt6aob76s5yatx7c2fnwm3whl2jvvirub3oix5cpiiakb3mx6q", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1843, "width": 3000}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 9, "replyCount": 7, "repostCount": 151, "likeCount": 310, "quoteCount": 13, "indexedAt": "2026-09-21T16:43:35.966Z", "labels": []}}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvsn3ahpin2i", "cid": "bafyreifi2v6pcwaoaseyeea42spobhvjjmnnexthrlqmkli4sigeaxnb7u", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh", "handle": "zekehausfather.com", "displayName": "Zeke Hausfather", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreickhtiozrypw6piordncabea5aztasgojgfb7467rjau6b3sr366m", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-09T21:00:55.757Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-18T16:54:18.000Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.video", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 480, "width": 640}, "video": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreig47vkhjvwdyh4q4yo5cnkh7zejfummhnixy5ihpziykz2gduz7dq"}, "mimeType": "video/mp4", "size": 30516708}}, "langs": [], "text": "Some folks are holding up the unusually quiet Atlantic hurricane season as some sort of \"gotcha\" for climate scientists. But low Atlantic hurricane activity has long been the signature of strong El Nino events, as memorably shown back in 1997: "}, "embed": {"cid": "bafkreig47vkhjvwdyh4q4yo5cnkh7zejfummhnixy5ihpziykz2gduz7dq", "playlist": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Ar5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreig47vkhjvwdyh4q4yo5cnkh7zejfummhnixy5ihpziykz2gduz7dq/playlist.m3u8", "thumbnail": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Ar5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreig47vkhjvwdyh4q4yo5cnkh7zejfummhnixy5ihpziykz2gduz7dq/thumbnail.jpg", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 480, "width": 640}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.video#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 22, "replyCount": 6, "repostCount": 49, "likeCount": 162, "quoteCount": 5, "indexedAt": "2026-09-18T16:54:55.064Z", "labels": []}}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:5buzphfdtce4ev3ukud2gf37/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvox2d4tvc2w", "cid": "bafyreiccxmaqgptnnhdteo7q2eb33cqwkytsx4ejjwnql2xwn2schwtrpa", "author": {"did": "did:plc:5buzphfdtce4ev3ukud2gf37", "handle": "laurimyllyvirta.bsky.social", "displayName": "Lauri Myllyvirta", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:5buzphfdtce4ev3ukud2gf37/bafkreiajru5cgew46zybmwnjsmhx3lo3v3shv6y6jyd752uduppvpkpyum", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-10-27T10:07:49.460Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-17T05:42:41.200Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.recordWithMedia", "media": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 598, "width": 900}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreiavk24c7upb4vqsgavpalvkzmtzw6ynsbzvetpbh5i4ap4pm6l3hu"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 147658}}]}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.record", "record": {"cid": "bafyreidr6esbuteenpdm3mkmtxlscc6jfimfr4ui3lvjyjmqs2tjtoi5na", "uri": "at://did:plc:2d6kuvaoa7qi6bq5cwq4isee/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvoamywvzu2c"}}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "NEW from us: India's rapid clean power expansion has kept power sector emissions flat for two years, for the first time in over 50 years, and sharply reduced fossil fuel imports. Oil and gas consumption have also fallen for two years in a row, helping alleviate the Hormuz shock."}, "embed": {"media": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:5buzphfdtce4ev3ukud2gf37/bafkreiavk24c7upb4vqsgavpalvkzmtzw6ynsbzvetpbh5i4ap4pm6l3hu", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:5buzphfdtce4ev3ukud2gf37/bafkreiavk24c7upb4vqsgavpalvkzmtzw6ynsbzvetpbh5i4ap4pm6l3hu", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 598, "width": 900}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "record": {"record": {"uri": "at://did:plc:2d6kuvaoa7qi6bq5cwq4isee/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvoamywvzu2c", "cid": "bafyreidr6esbuteenpdm3mkmtxlscc6jfimfr4ui3lvjyjmqs2tjtoi5na", "author": {"did": "did:plc:2d6kuvaoa7qi6bq5cwq4isee", "handle": "carbonbrief.org", "displayName": "Carbon Brief", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:2d6kuvaoa7qi6bq5cwq4isee/bafkreiggc4c2iwe6ka7roibtzfiv6sksntmdmaxhhvr