//usenergydata.org/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 222, "byteStart": 206}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "US Energy Data is an awesome new dashboard by @hannahritchie.bsky.social and the @ifp.bsky.social team that takes data from the inimitable DOE EIA and makes it far more accessible to the broader community: usenergydata.org"}, "embed": {"external": {"uri": "https://usenergydata.org/", "title": "Understanding America's energy system", "description": "Track and understand the numbers behind US energy — year by year, and state by state.", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreiddmfsn5ztmlaxo4lmiqbvprnmkijqimbnpf6y3vfw3kigikbkpr4"}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 19, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 22, "likeCount": 51, "quoteCount": 2, "indexedAt": "2026-09-14T17:30:50.962Z", "labels": []}, "opThreadPostIndex": 1, "opThreadPostCount": 3}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mviioohk5k2c", "cid": "bafyreifvtjpcrp55yetn77eoh7z2vkdbr62t7xbiff43rob7b5t7h2f3vy", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh", "handle": "zekehausfather.com", "displayName": "Zeke Hausfather", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreickhtiozrypw6piordncabea5aztasgojgfb7467rjau6b3sr366m", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-09T21:00:55.757Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-14T16:09:39.000Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 2030, "width": 2450}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreib2oipu2qnlrqmewed4a67xydnukl7jg6jva7yydpr5sbujkzh4mu"}, "mimeType": "image/png", "size": 443640}}]}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "With all the September runs of dynamic ENSO models now in (with the exception of SINTEX), we are even more likely to see a record-setting (or even record-shattering) event this year. Most models revised their projection upward, a few downward, and a few unchanged: "}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreib2oipu2qnlrqmewed4a67xydnukl7jg6jva7yydpr5sbujkzh4mu", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreib2oipu2qnlrqmewed4a67xydnukl7jg6jva7yydpr5sbujkzh4mu", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 2030, "width": 2450}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 5, "replyCount": 5, "repostCount": 25, "likeCount": 95, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-09-14T16:09:40.256Z", "labels": []}, "opThreadPostIndex": 1, "opThreadPostCount": 4}, {"post": {"uri": "at://did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mv6qpwzheu2n", "cid": "bafyreigv5wszkhgpfculbtnpwrd7p5fyg5wik3igmem64edvcbbqhzh3wa", "author": {"did": "did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh", "handle": "zekehausfather.com", "displayName": "Zeke Hausfather", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreickhtiozrypw6piordncabea5aztasgojgfb7467rjau6b3sr366m", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-05-09T21:00:55.757Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mpxwwvcick2h", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2026-07-06T11:03:33.662Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-09-10T19:06:54.000Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 2400}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreig22qhrnl7hgk2iibf3if2ok4y7zliwkrgsjzyor6z5ou56dmxrte"}, "mimeType": "image/png", "size": 165491}}]}, "langs": [], "text": "Not only was August 2026 the warmest August on record globally, but this summer as a whole (June, July, August) was also tied with 2024 as the warmest on record in the Copernicus/ECMWF ERA5 dataset:"}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreig22qhrnl7hgk2iibf3if2ok4y7zliwkrgsjzyor6z5ou56dmxrte", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:r5ofoghdcbtjqiujqpvja4uh/bafkreig22qhrnl7hgk2iibf3if2ok4y7zliwkrgsjzyor6z5ou56dmxrte", "alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 2400}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 3, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 36, "likeCount": 77, "quoteCount": 3, "indexedAt": "2026-09-10T19:06:55.662Z", "labels": []}}], "cursor": "2026-09-10T19:06:54Z"}